                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7d8d62f-1022-485d-8efe-adce2856f946",
                                                "sense_id": "6bd03612-1894-330b-af05-47cbcd158e73",
                                                "text": "a winky smiley face"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73c22b25-faea-429f-b358-0cf894c8e153",
                                                "sense_id": "6bd03612-1894-330b-af05-47cbcd158e73",
                                                "text": "Dickens aficionados will delight in winky references to his novels, as well as to his biography: Jenny Wren of “Our Mutual Friend” lends a nickname to Miss Ricketts; Alfred’s brother’s name is Sydney (as in Carton); and the One and Only’s death has left a “Drood”-like novel unfinished, occasioning wild speculation about its conclusion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42491671-6680-42ca-b214-f3722f03c057",
                                                "sense_id": "6bd03612-1894-330b-af05-47cbcd158e73",
                                                "text": "‘Yeah, but I put a winky smiley face on it. Did you not see?’ ‘That was a sad smiley face, you total fucking moron.[…]’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "753fe13f-2e62-4b46-908f-4f3546d56fc4",
                                                "sense_id": "6bd03612-1894-330b-af05-47cbcd158e73",
                                                "text": "He had included a winky face in his previous response. You don't haphazardly throw a winky face around like it's a thumbs-up or praise hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79176111-dee9-44ba-83c2-76e7e84ccb37",
                                                "sense_id": "6bd03612-1894-330b-af05-47cbcd158e73",
                                                "text": "I send a winky face emoji right after this, so he knows I am just teasing him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "winky",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0d23fac-a50a-3a95-8ba6-92fcb6be167c",
                                        "entry_id": "ccb730eb-cc2e-36af-a9b5-540c3cee1734",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An emoticon or smiley that shows a winking face, such as ;-) or 😉."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e75668c5-84d2-4d55-b840-a8b4104bb194",
                                                "sense_id": "b0d23fac-a50a-3a95-8ba6-92fcb6be167c",
                                                "text": "Crap, he sent a winky back. That was not good. Mixed signals were a bad way to start any kind of beginning, whether it was love or friendship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "winky",
